| `fv2_sim_<code>_<period>` | 模拟盘账户快照 | `views/sim.js` | 私有，外部不读 |
| `fv2_kline_*` / `fv2_futures` | 行情缓存 | `screener.js` Store | 只经 `Screener.readKlineCache` |
| `ft_stars` | 收藏 | `views/list.js` | 私有 |
